eading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}<\/style><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Job Opening - Logistics Software Sales Consultant<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-379e4fd e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"379e4fd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-87cb5cb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"87cb5cb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<p><strong>About Devlop<\/strong><\/p><p>Devlop is a Portuguese company specializing in Information Systems Engineering, dedicated to offering innovative and efficient solutions for Large, Medium, and Small Enterprises, with a special focus on Transport and Logistics management.<\/p><p>With over 25 years of market experience, we are IT leaders in the Transport and Logistics sector in Portugal, with a team of about 50 employees distributed across our offices in Cascais, Aveiro, and Leiria.<\/p><p>We are proud to serve a base of more than 400 clients, both national and international.<\/p><p>Our mission is to add value through digitalization, providing solutions that effectively respond to companies&#8217; needs, always with a strong focus on technological innovation.<\/p><p>We are seeking a Logistics Software Sales Consultant (M\/F) to join our commercial team.<\/p><p><strong>PROFILE<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Professional experience in ERP implementation in the Logistics area (preferred)<\/li><li>Degree in Engineering, Management, or similar<\/li><li>Ease of interpersonal relationships and excellent communication skills<\/li><li>Strong results orientation<\/li><li>Ability to work in a team and contribute to a common goal<\/li><li>Proactivity, motivation, and continuous improvement<\/li><li>Fluency in spoken and written Portuguese and English<\/li><li>Solid knowledge in the IT area<\/li><li>Ensure proper follow-up of all stages of the sales process<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>RESPONSIBILITIES<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Manage the commercial process from first contact to contract signing in accordance with company strategy<\/li><li>Prepare proposals for new and\/or current clients<\/li><li>Evaluate expressed or latent needs of potential clients proposing solutions<\/li><li>Prospect the market to identify new business opportunities<\/li><li>Conduct periodic technical-commercial visits<\/li><li>Ensure proper follow-up of all stages of the sales process<\/li><li>Promote the creation of new Leads through prospecting activities<\/li><li>Identify target clients and implement appropriate development strategies<\/li><li>Offer products or services through established client contacts: prospect clients to establish new commercial contacts<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>WE OFFER<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Incentives including training, certifications, additional paid vacation days, among others<\/li><li>Integration into a company that seeks constant innovation and adopts best practices<\/li><li>Hybrid work arrangement after training<\/li><\/ul><h5>Interested? If you meet the desired profile and are interested in this new professional opportunity, apply!<\/h5>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-53a21dc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"53a21dc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5d79ff5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-metform\" data-id=\"5d79ff5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"metform.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<div id=\"mf-response-props-id-15026\" data-previous-steps-style=\"\" data-editswitchopen=\"\" data-response_type=\"alert\" data-erroricon=\"fas fa-exclamation-triangle\" data-successicon=\"fas fa-check\" data-messageposition=\"top\" class=\"   mf-scroll-top-no\">\n\t\t<div class=\"formpicker_warper formpicker_warper_editable\" data-metform-formpicker-key=\"15026\" >\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<div\r\n\t\t\tid=\"metform-wrap-5d79ff5-15026\"\r\n\t\t\tclass=\"mf-form-wrapper\"\r\n\t\t\tdata-form-id=\"15026\"\r\n\t\t\tdata-action=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-json\/metform\/v1\/entries\/insert\/15026\"\r\n\t\t\tdata-wp-nonce=\"b08a0fb218\"\r\n\t\t\tdata-form-nonce=\"45991a0b2d\"\r\n\t\t\tdata-quiz-summery = \"false\"\r\n\t\t\tdata-save-progress = \"false\"\r\n\t\t\tdata-form-type=\"general-form\"\r\n\